{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/WesleyHuntTX/videos/john-cornyn-is-up-with-a-new-campaign-ad-naturally-it-needed-a-few-correctionsso/1566923077958270/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/WesleyHuntTX/videos/john-cornyn-is-up-with-a-new-campaign-ad-naturally-it-needed-a-few-correctionsso/1566923077958270/","title":"57K views · 1.7K reactions | John Cornyn is up with a new campaign ad.  Naturally it needed a few corrections.\n\nSo we FIXED IT for him. | Wesley Hunt","description":"John Cornyn is up with a new campaign ad.  Naturally it needed a few corrections.\n\nSo we FIXED IT for him.","language":"en","text":"I am profoundly grateful to President Trump for his confidence in me and for the extraordinary honor of being selected to represent the United States of America as Ambassador to the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.\nPresident Trump understands that American strength is the foundation of American peace.\nHis leadership has reshaped the Middle East, demanded more from our partners, stood firmly with our allies, and restored the understanding that when America speaks, the world should listen.\nI have believed in President Trump and his America First vision from the beginning, and I am deeply humbled that he has entrusted me with the responsibility of advancing that vision in one of the most strategically important relationships in the world.\nAs a soldier, I served our country in the Middle East. Now, President Trump has called on me to serve there once again, this time as a diplomat.\nI know the region.\nI know what is at stake.\nAnd I know the enormous opportunity before us.\nUnder President Trump’s leadership, we have a historic opportunity to deepen the U.S. Saudi partnership, strengthen American security, advance our economic and energy interests, confront our common adversaries, and build a more peaceful and prosperous Middle East through American strength.\nMr. President, thank you for your trust, your leadership, and the opportunity to serve this country once again.\nAmerica is worth fighting for.\nAnd it will be the honor of a lifetime to carry the President’s America First agenda to Riyadh.\nGod bless President Trump, God bless our men and women serving around the world, and God bless the United States of America.","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":1782.512696001504,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}